    "text": "If the function&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>f</mtext><mfenced><mtext>x</mtext></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mtext>x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>a</mtext><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mtext>&#160;sin&#160;x</mtext></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mtext>x&#160;cot&#160;x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>b</mtext></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext>a&#160;cos&#160;</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>x</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>b&#160;sin&#160;x&#160;&#160;</mtext></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mtext>x</mtext><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is continuous in <math> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>,&#160;</mtext> <mi>&#960;</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>, then the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> respectively are"
